{"id":"FLOW-E03","prompt":"Use the attached sum-from-1-to-100 flowchart. Complete a short trace for its first three loop passes, recording (N before test, Sum after addition, N after increment). State the final output.","responseType":"trace table","marks":5,"expectedAnswer":"Passes: (1,1,2), (2,3,3), (3,6,4). The chart continues through N=100 and prints 5050.","rubric":[{"criterion":"First pass state (1,1,2)","points":1},{"criterion":"Second pass state (2,3,3)","points":1},{"criterion":"Third pass state (3,6,4)","points":1},{"criterion":"Explains that condition is tested before each pass","points":1},{"criterion":"Gives final sum 5050","points":1}],"source":"PDF p. 15; flow.md ‘Adding the integers from 1 to 100’","operation":"trace a pre-test accumulator chart","stimulusAsset":"diagrams/sum_1_to_100.svg"},
